Most Common PLC Brands in Australia

For industrial maintenance and automation jobs in Australia, these are the PLC brands you'll see most often:

1. Siemens ⭐

Very common in:

Manufacturing
Food processing
Mining
Water treatment

Software:

TIA Portal
STEP 7

PLC Families:

S7-1200
S7-1500

If I had to pick one PLC platform to learn for Australia, it would be Siemens S7-1200/S7-1500.

2. Allen-Bradley (Rockwell Automation) ⭐

Extremely common in:

Mining
Heavy industry
Packaging
Manufacturing

Software:

Studio 5000
RSLogix 5000

PLC Families:

CompactLogix
ControlLogix
MicroLogix

