Advanced

Factory Monitoring Dashboard

Since you're learning web development:

PLC → MQTT → Node.js → PostgreSQL → React Dashboard

Features:

Production counts
Alarm history
Downtime tracking
OEE calculation

This combination of PLC + Web Development is very attractive because many factories are moving toward Industry 4.0 solutions.

